{"schemaVersion":1,"id":27,"sections":[{"id":"112004-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[880],"start":0,"count":9},{"id":"112004-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[10870],"start":9,"count":11},{"id":"112005-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[890],"start":20,"count":4},{"id":"112005-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[10880],"start":24,"count":7},{"id":"112006-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[900],"start":31,"count":11},{"id":"112006-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[10890],"start":42,"count":5}],"frames":[{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112004-PROLOGUE:880:2","scriptId":880,"text":"“从左右两侧包围旗帜所在的位置，但是不要靠近，只是埋伏在那。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112004-PROLOGUE:880:3","scriptId":880,"text":"“等目标出现以后再给他们狠狠一击。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112004-PROLOGUE:880:5","scriptId":880,"text":"很巧，这次旗帜又出现在偏向伏龙芝的方位，很快伏龙芝小队成员就到达了旗帜所在的位置，开始埋伏。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112004-PROLOGUE:880:6","scriptId":880,"text":"然而奇怪的是迟迟看不到桑赫斯特的队员。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112004-PROLOGUE:880:7","scriptId":880,"text":"“怎么还不来，我去把旗帜拿了走人～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":37,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112004-PROLOGUE:880:8","scriptId":880,"text":"“等等！不要随便出去！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":37,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112004-PROLOGUE:880:12","scriptId":880,"text":"佐伊刚起身，往外走了几步，就被一轮炮火炸得遍体鳞伤……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":34,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112004-PROLOGUE:880:13","scriptId":880,"text":"“呜呃……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":34,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112004-PROLOGUE:880:14","scriptId":880,"text":"“唉……你这个急性子……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":34,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112004-EPILOGUE:10870:1","scriptId":10870,"text":"看来敌人也和我们想得一样，也是在旗帜周围进行了埋伏。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":34,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112004-EPILOGUE:10870:2","scriptId":10870,"text":"除了早早退场的佐伊，剩下的人开始进行激烈炮火对射。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":34,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":754,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112004-EPILOGUE:10870:3","scriptId":10870,"text":"“哼，对面少一个人，我们要抓住这个机会一举击溃她们！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":754,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":761,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112004-EPILOGUE:10870:4","scriptId":10870,"text":"“丹妮丝和利薇尔援护射击，塞姬和安娜去夺旗！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":761,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112004-EPILOGUE:10870:5","scriptId":10870,"text":"仗着援护射击，塞姬和安娜很快就拿到了旗帜，就在这时----","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":761,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112004-EPILOGUE:10870:8","scriptId":10870,"text":"两发从侧面飞来的炮弹正中塞姬和安娜，瞬间退场两名。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":761,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":757,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112004-EPILOGUE:10870:9","scriptId":10870,"text":"“什么情况！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":757,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":262,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112004-EPILOGUE:10870:10","scriptId":10870,"text":"“是远距离的大口径火炮攻击！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":262,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":352,"speaker":"茜罗娅·约德尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112004-EPILOGUE:10870:11","scriptId":10870,"text":"“就等你们来抢旗帜了～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":262,"right":352,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":98,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112004-EPILOGUE:10870:12","scriptId":10870,"text":"“太好了，我也命中了敌人。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":262,"right":98,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112004-EPILOGUE:10870:13","scriptId":10870,"text":"“可恶，注意力都被他们前排的队员吸引住了，忘记了他们还有大威力远程射手。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":752,"right":98,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112005-PROLOGUE:890:2","scriptId":890,"text":"战局进入了胶着状态，仗着远处火炮的范围打击，完全压制住了桑赫斯特的进攻态势。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":752,"right":98,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":761,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112005-PROLOGUE:890:3","scriptId":890,"text":"“现在只能战略后退了，进入僵持是随了伏龙芝的意，这局算他们赢了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":761,"right":98,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":260,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112005-PROLOGUE:890:4","scriptId":890,"text":"“可恶，旗帜就在眼前。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":761,"right":260,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":761,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112005-PROLOGUE:890:5","scriptId":890,"text":"“全员撤退！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":761,"right":260,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112005-EPILOGUE:10880:1","scriptId":10880,"text":"由于出其不意的减员，让桑赫斯特放弃了当前这局，第二场夺旗战伏龙芝小胜。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":761,"right":260,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":219,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112005-EPILOGUE:10880:2","scriptId":10880,"text":"“唉呀，看来桑赫斯特的技战术也不过如此嘛。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":761,"right":219,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":292,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112005-EPILOGUE:10880:3","scriptId":10880,"text":"“哼，只是队员们大意了，毕竟没有想到你们会如此阴险，故意卖一个队友来赚取我方的松懈。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":292,"right":219,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112005-EPILOGUE:10880:4","scriptId":10880,"text":"“这才是有大局观的战略战术～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":292,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":292,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112005-EPILOGUE:10880:5","scriptId":10880,"text":"“哼，狗屎运而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":292,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":292,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112005-EPILOGUE:10880:6","scriptId":10880,"text":"“正常交战是绝对不可能被你们如此轻易得手的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":292,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112005-EPILOGUE:10880:7","scriptId":10880,"text":"“这叫造化弄人～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":292,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112006-PROLOGUE:900:2","scriptId":900,"text":"伏龙芝临时指挥部----","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":292,"right":211,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112006-PROLOGUE:900:3","scriptId":900,"text":"“很好，局势上面我们现在优势比较明显。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112006-PROLOGUE:900:4","scriptId":900,"text":"“恩，这次的功劳主要是在佐伊，引蛇出洞，做得非常漂亮。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112006-PROLOGUE:900:5","scriptId":900,"text":"“诶？是我的功劳？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112006-PROLOGUE:900:6","scriptId":900,"text":"“虽然没听命令自己冲了出去……是需要批评的。好在结果还不错。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112006-PROLOGUE:900:7","scriptId":900,"text":"“这次就先放你一马，不写进报告里了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112006-PROLOGUE:900:8","scriptId":900,"text":"“哈哈，看到我佐伊的精彩发挥了吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":37,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":91,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112006-PROLOGUE:900:9","scriptId":900,"text":"“不过就是冲出去被炸成渣……歪打正着而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":91,"right":37,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112006-PROLOGUE:900:10","scriptId":900,"text":"“通过这次，我估计桑赫斯特应该不会再冒进了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":37,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112006-PROLOGUE:900:11","scriptId":900,"text":"“恩，后面三场比赛才是真正较量的开始。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112006-PROLOGUE:900:12","scriptId":900,"text":"“下一场是攻防战，大家要打起精神来。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112006-EPILOGUE:10890:1","scriptId":10890,"text":"攻防战主要的目标是摧毁敌人的据点，不过一般炮弹对据点的墙壁没有什么效果，所以大多数情况都是想办法入侵据点从内部寻找突破口。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112006-EPILOGUE:10890:2","scriptId":10890,"text":"“作为防御方，我们可以占领几个重要的据点位置，不让伏龙芝入侵就行了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":752,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112006-EPILOGUE:10890:3","scriptId":10890,"text":"“正面防御有我和芬妮，应该不成问题，侧后方的防御就交给丹妮丝指挥。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":752,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":259,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112006-EPILOGUE:10890:4","scriptId":10890,"text":"“就交给我吧，队长大人。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":752,"right":259,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112006-EPILOGUE:10890:5","scriptId":10890,"text":"“物资方面，因为给塞姬和安娜做了修复，已经所剩无几了。下面这场战斗尽量要依靠掩体来减少损伤。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":752,"right":259,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["第二场夺旗战开始。","虽然损失了佐伊的战斗力，但是对面也减员两名，局势上面还是我方有利。","总算是扳回一城，虽然赢得比较有运气成分。"]}
